# Initial Care Reality Assessment (2B)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-initial-care-reality-assessment.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-initial-care-reality-assessment.md)

## Rule

No durable baseline **and** no same-turn stated usual/used-to **and** no held ACS observations from earlier turns → **Initial Assessment Mode**.

Do **not** say: different from before · decline · new behavior · getting worse.

When ACS already holds prior observations → graduate out of Initial Assessment (continuing story / related update). Still never invent decline without usual-pattern evidence.

## Paths

| Mode | Goal |
|------|------|
| Initial assessment | Current situation → known / unknown → seed baseline |
| Change detection / continuing | Comparable prior exists (baseline discourse, durable familiarity, or held care memory) |

New user = **situation**. Returning / comparable prior = **change or continuation**.

